{'symbol': 'DFS', 'date': '2020-05-04 20:30:00', 'title': 'DISCOVER FINANCIAL SERVICES SAYS LAWRENCE A. WEINBACH, CHAIRMAN OF BOARD, DIED UNEXPECTEDLY', 'text': "DISCOVER FINANCIAL SERVICES -  ON MAY 1, LAWRENCE A. WEINBACH, CHAIRMAN OF BOARD OF CO, DIED UNEXPECTEDLY.DISCOVER FINANCIAL - BOARD HAS DETERMINED NOT TO FILL VACANCY CREATED BY WEINBACH'S PASSING, NOR TO APPOINT SUCCESSOR NOMINEE FOR ELECTION.DISCOVER FINANCIAL SERVICES - BOARD VOTED TO REDUCE FULL SIZE OF BOARD FROM TWELVE TO ELEVEN MEMBERS.DISCOVER FINANCIAL SERVICES - ON MAY 4, 2020, BOARD ELECTED DIRECTOR THOMAS G. MAHERAS TO SERVE AS ITS CHAIRMAN, EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY."}